WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.750
This is a work of fiction. Names, characters, organizations, laws, etc.

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.750
are products of the author's imagination or used fictitiously.

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:03.380
I'm home!

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:05.750
Hey, Koushi-

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:09.500
Stare...

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:10.920
U-um...

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:13.250
Who's this?

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:16.380
Th-this is Sutea Khoroya.

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:20.460
She's a classmate of mine.
We've been friends since preschool.

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:23.290
Miss Atena is one of the residents here.

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:25.000
And, uh...

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.250
Oh! She's a totally normal person.

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:30.080
N-normal? What kind of introduction is that?

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:33.170
In a dorm like this,
normal is the best thing you can be!

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:35.790
The mark of a boring personality...

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.710
A classic childhood friend character?
How wonderful!

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:41.250
She's better than I imagined...!

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:44.250
Whoa, Miss Frey!

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:49.380
I'm sorry, but Sutea doesn't like to be touched
on account of her medical condition.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:53.330
Ooh, impressive.

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:56.540
You're one to talk...

00:00:57.540 --> 00:00:59.000
Quit smothering me!

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.250
Sorry!

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:02.250
Koushi!

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:03.420
Throb

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:03.420
Throb

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:03.750
Huff

00:01:03.670 --> 00:01:06.250
Wow. Is this how middle schoolers...

00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:04.630
Huff

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:05.380
Huff

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:06.080
Huff

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:08.670
...show affection these days?

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:06.830
Huff

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:07.580
Huff

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:11.580
I, uh, don't think that's the case...

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:18.540
Blush

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:18.540
I did it again...

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:20.170
Wouldja look at that?

00:01:20.170 --> 00:01:22.170
How very interesting...

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:26.000
If I didn't know any better, I'd say that she...

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:28.540
Yes, she most definitely does...

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:30.130
Wait, what?

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:31.630
Atena...

00:01:32.170 --> 00:01:35.210
You've got quite the formidable
opponent on your hands.

00:01:35.210 --> 00:01:37.000
What are you talking about?

00:01:37.210 --> 00:01:39.460
You mustn't allow a childhood
friend character to beat you!

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:42.540
I-I don't think of Koushi that way!

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:44.790
Have you forgotten that I'm his (pseudo) sister?!

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:47.250
Ho-ho! A big sister character
might stand a chance...

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:48.130
Like I said...!

00:01:48.130 --> 00:01:50.130
Hold it right there!

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:52.420
By "big sister," you mean me, right?

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:53.500
Thought so!

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:56.170
You ought to at least put "(pseudo)"
in front of "sister"!

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:58.000
I don't see the problem.

00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:01.380
I'm the most suitable candidate
for the position, anyway.

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:04.290
And I won't stand for such an insult!

00:02:06.130 --> 00:02:07.250
That's enough!

00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:12.670
As for whether or not this dorm is
an appropriate environment for Koushi...

00:02:12.670 --> 00:02:15.040
...I will be the judge of that!

00:02:15.710 --> 00:02:16.630
Huh?

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:33.380
Shiranai furi o shiteru dake desho?

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:36.420
Mother of the Goddess' Dormitory

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:36.290
Hitomi no oku ni honne deteru yo

00:02:36.290 --> 00:02:39.290
Dramatic na koi nanka janai

00:02:39.290 --> 00:02:42.920
Hotetta karada toketeshimaisou

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:45.880
Hontou wa tereteru dake

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:48.830
Okufukaku ijirasete yo

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:51.580
Konna fuku kisasechau no

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:54.540
Kimi dake ni hora dokidoki shiteru

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:59.960
Aru ga mama nasu ga mama nagasarete

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:02.960
Glass no mukou nozokikondara

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:06.380
Tsuyameku sweety na sekai

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:11.880
Mukiatte dakishimete kowareru hodo

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:14.830
Kimi no kodou ga kanjireru kurai

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:17.210
Soba ni kite hoshii na

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:19.540
Torokesou na love

00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:23.830
Itazura na ai de kimi no koto madowasu no

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:25.380
Torokesou na love

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:30.130
Shitai koto zenbu suki ni shite kamawanai yo

00:03:30.130 --> 00:03:32.830
Yubisaki de nazotte

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:36.250
Amai amai yume misete ageru yo

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:38.880
Kuchibiru o mitsumete

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:42.040
I wanna kiss you motto motto

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:54.080
Episode 4

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:54.080
A Childhood Friend Visits the Dorm

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:01.330
Sutea's

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:01.330
Goddess Dormitory

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:01.330
Caution Meter

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:04.540
Um... This is my room...

00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:12.330
Sutea's

00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:12.330
Goddess Dormitory

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:12.330
Caution Meter

00:04:15.210 --> 00:04:17.290
Uh, Miss Atena?

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:21.040
O-oh, I was just admiring how clean it is in here!

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:24.920
Nah, I just don't have a whole lot of stuff...

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:26.790
No, it's true!

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:28.670
You always do a great job cleaning up the dorm.

00:04:28.670 --> 00:04:30.040
It's a huge help!

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:32.080
And your cooking is delicious, too!

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:32.580
Sutea's

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:32.580
Goddess Dormitory

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:32.580
Caution Meter

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:37.000
Either way, is inspecting every room
in the dorm really necessary...?

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:40.080
I'm giving you the opportunity to redeem yourself.

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:41.460
You ought to be grateful!

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:43.170
B-but...

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:44.960
No need to fret!

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:47.960
Now then, shall we move on to our rooms next?

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:51.080
Let's start with my room.

00:04:51.830 --> 00:04:53.540
Here we are!

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:56.080
Sutea's

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:56.080
Goddess Dormitory

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:56.080
Caution Meter

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:59.830
Didn't you have a toxic gas leak
just a little while ago?!

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:01.790
Is this even safe?!

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:04.500
No worries, it's fine!

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:07.080
It should've cleared up by now...

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:13.290
Tee-hee! Looks like we can't go in.

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:14.670
Close the door!

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:19.790
Y'see, Miss Mineru is a researcher.

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:24.380
The experiments she conducts
tend to fail most of the time...

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:28.420
That reminds me of a rumor I heard at school...

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:31.040
"The Toxic Lady of Seikan Women's University"...

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:33.500
Why does it sound like some sort of urban legend?!

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:34.750
Danger...

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:35.290
Sutea's

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:35.290
Goddess Dormitory

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:35.290
Caution Meter

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:37.750
Jeez. What's the matter with you, Mineru?

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:40.250
Rumble...

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:39.960
Next, it's my turn!

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:48.460
I enjoy wearing and dressing others in cosplay.

00:05:48.460 --> 00:05:52.830
I also enjoy sewing clothes, so my room has
basically turned into a costume department.

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:57.080
Look, this is my newest creation!

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:59.170
Isn't it just delightful?!

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:03.670
Sutea's

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:03.670
Goddess Dormitory

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:03.670
Caution Meter

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:03.330
What's this? Oh my goodness...

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:05.920
This costume...

00:06:06.290 --> 00:06:08.920
would look perfect on you!

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:08.920
Twinkle

00:06:08.920 --> 00:06:10.540
Let's try it on right now!

00:06:11.670 --> 00:06:13.580
C-cut it out!

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:16.210
Oh, what luxurious fabric!

00:06:16.670 --> 00:06:19.170
I think this outfit suits you beautifully, too!

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:21.080
Hey, don't touch me there!

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:23.210
Don't pull on that!

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:24.880
Don't touch me!

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:28.880
We change clothes when we change clothes,
and if we change clothes, then the clothes change...!

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:31.380
KNOCK IT OFF!

00:06:33.380 --> 00:06:42.420
Sutea's

00:06:33.380 --> 00:06:42.420
Goddess Dormitory

00:06:33.380 --> 00:06:42.420
Caution Meter

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:36.210
Stop it, Frey!

00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:40.290
Well this is going terribly...

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:42.420
Leave the rest to me!

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:45.420
My name is Atena Saotome.

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:47.420
Room 205 belongs to me...

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:49.630
and this is what it looks like.

00:06:51.170 --> 00:06:52.420
Hmm...

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:54.420
Sutea's

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:54.420
Goddess Dormitory

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:54.420
Caution Meter

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:55.790
It's normal.

00:06:55.670 --> 00:07:01.920
NORMAL

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:59.000
It's boring compared to the others'...

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:01.920
Why do I suddenly feel jealous
of their personalities?!

00:07:02.170 --> 00:07:06.500
Wow... This is the first time
I've gotten a good look at your room.

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:09.000
It's kind of relaxing...

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:11.880
And it smells really nice, too.

00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:13.250
Huh?!

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:14.170
Ba-thump

00:07:15.670 --> 00:07:18.710
Sutea's

00:07:15.670 --> 00:07:18.710
Goddess Dormitory

00:07:15.670 --> 00:07:18.710
Caution Meter

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:18.330
But why?!

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:19.920
Huh?!

00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:22.000
Wh-wh-what do I do?!

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:28.540
It's time for the real (pseudo) sister
to shine, don'tcha think?

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:35.290
Maybe I shouldn't mention that "real (pseudo) sister"
is, in fact, a total oxymoron...

00:07:36.710 --> 00:07:38.460
I'm Kiriya Sensho.

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:41.830
I was raised by a family of martial artists,
so I'm a little rough around the edges...

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:45.880
...but I enjoy reading shojo manga like this one.

00:07:46.170 --> 00:07:48.670
So feel free to come and visit any time.

00:07:48.790 --> 00:07:50.790
Sutea's

00:07:48.790 --> 00:07:50.790
Goddess Dormitory

00:07:48.790 --> 00:07:50.790
Caution Meter

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:53.330
Whoa! Nice job, Miss Kiriya!

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:56.420
Sutea let her guard down almost instantly!

00:07:56.960 --> 00:07:59.630
I highly recommend giving this one a try.

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:09.250
Calm down, Kiriya!

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:13.420
Sutea's

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:13.420
Goddess Dormitory

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:13.420
Caution Meter

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:12.670
How can you be embarrassed
by your own recommendation?!

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:15.290
S-sorry!

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:18.750
This dorm... is far too dangerous.

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:26.670
Mmph

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:28.880
Take this rice cracker.

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:32.880
If you eat it, the flavor and the crunch
will help you forget your troubles.

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:39.750
Whoops, they're past the expiration date.

00:08:40.420 --> 00:08:43.290
Sutea's

00:08:40.420 --> 00:08:43.290
Goddess Dormitory

00:08:40.420 --> 00:08:43.290
Caution Meter

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:45.750
I'm going to BURN THIS DORM!

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:48.380
Take it easy, Sutea!

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:55.040
On that note, it's already getting late.

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:58.250
And we'd also like an opportunity
to redeem ourselves, so...

00:08:58.630 --> 00:09:03.040
we've decided that Sutea is going to
stay here for the night!

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:04.830
Bum-bada-bum!

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:07.790
Everyone under the same roof!

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:09.500
Bum-bada-bum!

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:12.580
Under the same roof...

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:14.540
You really don't mind?

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:17.330
Anything for a childhood friend of yours, Koushi.

00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:19.250
Sorry to burden you.

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:20.210
Offended!

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:22.920
But whose room should she sleep in?

00:09:22.920 --> 00:09:24.250
Good point...

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:29.210
M-mine...?

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:33.130
Saotome

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:35.630
I think that should do it.

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:44.670
Yikes! Why is she glaring at me like that?

00:09:44.670 --> 00:09:46.460
Did I do something wrong?

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:48.460
C'mon, this is my chance!

00:09:48.460 --> 00:09:50.880
I have to make sure this is a fun sleepover!

00:09:51.130 --> 00:09:52.380
Um...

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:56.500
You're Koushi's childhood friend, right, Sutea?

00:09:56.500 --> 00:10:00.000
What was Koushi like when he was younger?

00:10:01.670 --> 00:10:04.210
I'm assuming that he was kind...

00:10:04.210 --> 00:10:06.290
Responsible and reliable, too.

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:08.210
Why bother asking me?

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:09.040
Huh?

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:12.830
I was supposed to know everything about Koushi.

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:17.880
But now, he's working as a dorm mother
for a bunch of strangers...

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:21.540
What's their...

00:10:22.130 --> 00:10:25.040
What exactly is your relationship with Koushi?!

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:35.040
I hope Sutea and Miss Atena
are getting along with each other...

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:38.670
No use worrying about it, I guess...

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:40.630
I'm starting to feel dizzy...

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:46.460
What do you mean by our "relationship"?

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:01.630
I-I just...

00:11:11.420 --> 00:11:12.420
Koushi?!

00:11:13.960 --> 00:11:15.500
Ow-ow-ow...

00:11:17.710 --> 00:11:21.170
Sutea's

00:11:17.710 --> 00:11:21.170
Goddess Dormitory

00:11:17.710 --> 00:11:21.170
Caution Meter

00:11:21.420 --> 00:11:24.670
I'm going to DESTROY THIS DORM!

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:33.960
W-we're sorry...

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:36.460
Well? How did this happen?

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:40.170
I got kinda dizzy after I zoned out in the bath...

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:42.960
Do you always mount women when you're dizzy?

00:11:44.290 --> 00:11:48.710
Kiriya, you already took a bath
with us girls earlier, didn't you?

00:11:48.710 --> 00:11:53.880
Y'see, I got sweaty after I did some training
before bed, so I figured I'd rinse off...

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:56.170
That's when I accidentally walked in on Koushi...

00:11:56.420 --> 00:11:59.250
Not so much "walked in on" as "docked in on."

00:11:59.250 --> 00:12:00.330
Sutea?!

00:12:01.710 --> 00:12:04.290
Miss Kiriya, I hope you can forgive me.

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:06.250
I should've been paying more attention...

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:09.750
No, I should've realized that you were in there.

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:10.830
I'm sorry.

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:11.670
But...

00:12:11.670 --> 00:12:14.500
Don't worry! I don't mind being seen naked.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:16.170
Maybe you should!

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:19.630
Nah. It doesn't bother me
since you're like a little brother.

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:22.040
Does your little brother always mount you?

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:22.040
Mutter...

00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:22.960
Wha-?!

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:30.380
You certainly seem to mind now!

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:32.460
No, I just...!

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:38.290
You're so unfair...

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:39.330
Huh?

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:41.710
You act like you're older,
but then you get flustered...

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:44.170
So which is it, already?!

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:45.960
"Which is it?"

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:53.830
I don't get it...

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:07.630
It's totally unfair!

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:19.040
Episode 4

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:19.040
Koushi Goes Undercover at a Women's College

00:13:19.670 --> 00:13:23.040
A few days later

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:33.000
Uh... Is it not to your liking?

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:35.210
Thanks for breakfast.

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:39.080
Miss Atena? Miss Kiriya?!

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:40.830
See you later.

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:44.630
I wonder what's gotten into them...

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:48.580
Atena and Kiriya seem pretty out of it lately.

00:13:49.080 --> 00:13:51.630
It's been like this since the day Sutea stayed over.

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:54.710
But they don't look sick or anything like that...

00:13:54.710 --> 00:13:57.460
Did you do something to upset them?

00:13:58.000 --> 00:13:59.460
No, I haven't-

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:05.080
So something did happen!

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:07.250
N-no, nothing happened!

00:14:07.460 --> 00:14:09.210
Piggy Bank

00:14:07.460 --> 00:14:09.210
of Love

00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:10.710
Oh no!

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:14.630
What's the matter?

00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:17.790
Miss Atena and Miss Kiriya forgot their lunch.

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:22.250
They told me that they can't eat on campus
since they don't get their allowances until tomorrow...

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:25.210
Please give us leftovers...

